  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Get it away from me right now!! Those Demons next to us will end up killing
      both of us !
  - speaker: 0
    text: "But why does everyone seem to be afraid of this object ? Isn\u2019t it
      one of our links with God ?"
  - speaker: 1
    text: Listen to me, traveler, if our lord really existed, he would never have
      allowed my daughter to be taken from me in such an atrocious manner, and those
      monsters in the monastery would be punished.
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Honestly, I don\u2019t understand you... Why believe in such a cruel god?"
